{"channelId":"UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","row":["Sarvoham Animal Foundation",529,"Sarvoham Animal Foundation is a remarkable dog shelter that has been dedicated to rescuing and caring for stray animals.\nIn the past 6 years Sarvoham has grown from a small charity and has blossomed into a well-organized animal welfare organization which has rescued more than 3000 street animals and currently homes to more than 200 dogs at its shelter.\n\nThrough our YouTube channel, we aim to share heartwarming rescue stories, heart-touching journeys of rehabilitation, and joyful tales of successful adoptions. By watching and subscribing to our channel, you can become a part of our mission and help us spread awareness about the importance of animal welfare and adoption.\n\nDon't forget to hit the subscribe button and click the bell icon to stay updated with our latest rescue missions and adoption success stories. Your support means the world to us and the animals we care for","","India"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:56.417Z","channelId":"UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1634d5c4113121aa433f8f7c13659afd6825c05d554b0c325318352f75593689","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3f4d3429c3f5b2cbaadce2adfd518b225df9b4029f783b4e2b7c52bb0a9c5d7c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:56.417Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":529,"raw":"529 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZgPBwiJM4amHEtF1w5lZ3Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:56.417Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorit